chapter AFP

session EventStruct = Core +
  description \<open>
    EventStruct: the SMRD event-structure semantics -- events, preserved program
    order ppo, semantic dependency DP, executions; the future set Phi (a set of
    edge-sets over event-labels, one per execution, matching the generated Phi_P),
    histories, posterior futures, the horizon horizonPhi_H (how the operational
    layer consults Phi: the next enabled actions given a history H), the
    instruction-granularity membership (l : abar) :elem: horizonPhi_H, and an
    episodicity predicate. Defines how Phi is CONSUMED; mordor is the oracle that
    PRODUCES concrete Phi. Depends only on Core. (Episodic stack layer 3;
    AFP-capable.)
  \<close>
  options [timeout = 600]
  theories
    EventStruct
